      "content": "therapists just tell you to \"wait it out,\" but what if there's nothing left to wait for? i've always been the one in control, the one who makes things happen. now i'm just a spectator to my own ruin. it feels more like a loss of dignity than a loss of money, you know? like, is there any way to stay in control of how this ends, or am i just forced to sit here and let everyone watch me fail?",
